  "claim_scope": "Label-free, retrospective structure-and-charge sidecar over the already frozen 116-case FreeSolv reserve energy artifact. It identifies strict heavy-atom matched-pair edges from all non-uniquified embeddings of the single SMARTS returned by RDKit FindMCS 2024.09.2 and measures within-AM1-BCC remote-heavy-atom charge drift. Distinct maximum-MCS pattern alternatives are not enumerated. This is not a charge-model comparison, accuracy score, fitted correction, threshold calibration, endpoint selection, or certified-ranking result.",
